Article 13 (Details of support for excellent information security technology)
The Minister of Science and ICT may provide the following support to a person who has obtained designation as excellent information security technology, etc. pursuant to Article 18 (1) of the Act: <Amended on Jul. 26, 2017>
Support for providing prototypes and commercialization;
Support for startup and advertising;
Support for new market opening and exportation.
