Article 20 (Projects and supervision of association)
The Association shall implement the following projects concerning the information security industry:
Researching and proposing improvements to systems for creating the environment for the information security industry;
Supporting training of human resources for information security;
Researching the current status and preparing statistics related to the information security industry;
Researching technical trends and activities to disseminate new technologies concerning the information security industry;
Preparing statements of opinion on whether an enterprise is an information security enterprise;
Facilitating international cooperation and overseas expansion concerning the information security industry;
Researching standards for reasonable prices for information security technology, etc. of the information security industry;
Technical research necessary for the information security industry;
Other projects necessary for developing the information security industry and achieving the objectives of incorporation of the Association.
Where the Minister of Science and ICT deems that the Association implements projects other than the objectives provided in this Decree and its articles of incorporation, he or she may request the Association to rectify its projects. <Amended on Jul. 26, 2017>

